The regular expression `questionRow` is compiled dynamically inside the `map` loop for every single line of the page(s). This is highly inefficient and can be optimized by compiling the regex once outside the loop.

```suggestion
  const questionRegex = new RegExp('^(?:Q\\s*)?0*' + questionNumber + '(?:\\b|(?=\\())', 'i');
  const starts = lines.map((line, index) => questionRegex.test(line.text) ? index : -1).filter(index => index >= 0);
```

